---
layout: layouts/page.njk
noindex: true
title: "Thank You | The Café"
description: "Thanks for getting in touch with The Café, Leavenworth, KS."
---
{#- Where a form lands when the browser runs no JavaScript: Web3Forms
    redirects here (the form's hidden "redirect" field). With JavaScript the
    thank-you shows in place on the form's own page and nobody sees this.
    Unlisted: noindex and off the sitemap, since it means nothing on its own.
    Worded for any form, so the contact and survey forms can point here too. -#}
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="thanks-heading" style="text-align: center;">
            <div class="container">
                <h1 id="thanks-heading">Thank you! We got it.</h1>
                <p style="margin-top: 1rem; max-width: 55ch; margin-inline: auto;">
                    Your message is on its way to us. If you sent a catering request,
                    we&rsquo;ll reach out soon to go over the details.
                </p>
                <p style="margin-top: 0.75rem; max-width: 55ch; margin-inline: auto;">
                    Need us sooner? Call <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phone }}</a>.
                </p>
                <div style="margin-top: 2rem; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.8rem; justify-content: center;">
                    <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">Home</a>
                    <a href="/menu" class="btn btn-primary">See the Menu</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
